  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Optum Public Sector Solutions reported $6.6B in contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Optum Public Sector Solutions received 21 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $317M. Optum Public Sector Solutions obligations fell 70.4% year over year. Historical obligations show a growth phase through FY25 followed by the current-year drop. Optum Public Sector Solutions obligations were $8.9B in FY21, $14.5B in FY22, $16.2B in FY23, $20.1B in FY24, and $22.5B in FY25. The current FY2026 total is partial and reflects fiscal year to date activity rather than a full-year result. Optum Public Sector Solutions figures here are contract obligations except where award-value notes are identified separately in other tables. Optum Public Sector Solutions had a significantly higher run rate in FY25 than in the current fiscal year to date. Optum Public Sector Solutions performance this year will need to be compared to full-year totals once FY2026 closes to understand whether the year-to-date decline persists into the full fiscal year.",
